              "line1": "<h3><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Your grip, your way</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">BPX offers a variety of grip options, empowering your performance — however you prefer to hold it. And the smaller battery grip is made for a range of hand sizes.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\"> </span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Freedom to move</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">BPX brings agility and maneuverability to your extremities procedures.<sup>1</sup> It's the power move that moves with you.</span></span></p>\r\n",
