          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Apr 13 2026 20:13:40 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Flex Financial</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Get the equipment you need now and keep your cash for emergencies.</span></span></p>\n<p>Through Stryker’s Flex Financial program, we provide comprehensive solutions that make it easier to meet your clinical and financial goals. We offer flexibility beyond a cash purchase, enabling you to acquire our full portfolio of products.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/services-and-solutions/flex-financial.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Learn more</span></span></a></p>\n",
